 "text": "Hi! How's life treating you? About six months before the end of the reservation. That way you've got time to change it without paying a full price. August is busy here. If you can go earlier, you' save a lot of money and have more choices. Email is fine. Many places only print out a few paper ones, and they go out quickly if it' busy weekend. Grandparents love that. A picture of the family on the back is the best part. Keep them short and to the point. If there's a venue code, put it on the card and on the booking page.",
